          },
          "volatile": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "true if this is a STATE that goes stale and should be replaced by a later write (a rate, a plan); false/omitted for an EVENT, which is append-only. Recorded and returned by recall; supersession is still an explicit act, not automatic"
